# Xcode derived data, user state, and generated project files.
# PhiloticApp/PhiloticApp.xcodeproj is regenerated from project.yml by
# `xcodegen generate` (wired into `just app-build` / `just app-test`), so it
# is not checked in.

## Build products
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcarchive

## Generated Xcode project (regenerated via `xcodegen generate`)
PhiloticApp/PhiloticApp.xcodeproj/

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved

## Per-user Xcode state (relevant if a project is ever checked in)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Simulator / device logs and crash reports incidentally captured locally
*.ips
*.crash

## macOS noise
.DS_Store
